+4. **Filter by Reprojection Error:** Calculate the reprojection error $\varepsilon^i$ for each triangulated point $X_i$ [S1]. Retain points where $\varepsilon^i < \tau$; discard points where $\varepsilon^i \ge \tau$ [S1].
 
